    "body": "# Ohio State Fisher SMF Graduate Assistantship (SCH-112)\n\n- **Category:** Assistantship · **Type:** assistantship\n- **Status (2026-10-26):** Automatic consideration (1 appointment/year)\n- **Scope:** ohio-msf\n- **Programs:** ohio-msf\n- **HK eligible:** yes · **TW eligible:** yes · **International:** yes · **PRC:** yes\n\n## Summary\nSMF awards up to one Graduate Assistant appointment each year. GA is 10 hours/week and provides a 50% tuition waiver plus a monthly stipend. All admitted applicants automatically considered; no separate application. Subject to annual financial-aid budget.\n\n## Eligibility\nAdmitted Fisher SMF students; extremely limited (≤1/year).\n\n## Amount\n50% tuition waiver + monthly stipend (stipend $ not published on page)\n\n## Deadline\nWith admission (auto consideration)\n\n## Notes\nDistinct from cash merit SCH-111.\n\n## Sources\n- [Fisher SMF Tuition & Funding — GA](https://fisher.osu.edu/graduate/smf/admissions/tuition-funding)\n\n_Do not treat amounts/deadlines as final; re-verify on the official page before applying._\n"
