    "body": "# Taiwan MOE Government Scholarship to Study Abroad (GSSA 留學獎學金) — general (SCH-018)\n\n- **Category:** Local · **Type:** scholarship\n- **Status (2026-10-20):** 2027 cycle not yet published\n- **Scope:** Any foreign university (not mainland China/HK/Macau)\n- **Programs:** mit-cs, multi (PhD only)\n- **HK eligible:** no · **TW eligible:** yes · **International:** no\n\n## Summary\nTaiwan Ministry of Education merit scholarship selected by document review; applicants must already hold an admission letter.\n\n## Eligibility\nROC nationals with household registration in Taiwan; ≤45; admission from a recognised foreign university. General students: doctoral degree only (except arts/architecture/New Southbound countries). Hong Kong: not applicable. So MS CS / MBA NOT eligible under general category.\n\n## Amount\nGeneral students: US$16,000 per year, max 2 years (115/2026 brochure)\n\n## Deadline\n2026 (115) cycle: 16 Jan–13 Feb 2026 (latest published); 2027 cycle unknown\n\n## Sources\n- [MOE GSSA portal](https://www.scholarship.moe.gov.tw/scholarship)\n- [115 GSSA brochure PDF](https://ws.moe.edu.tw/001/Upload/7/relfile/9909/103401/7332fb46-00f7-4ed4-9af7-6fc63a301b13.pdf)\n\n_Do not treat amounts/deadlines as final; re-verify on the official page before applying._\n"
