    "body": "# Rochester Simon Evans Lam George Eastman Circle Scholarship (SCH-098)\n\n- **Category:** Merit-Based · **Type:** scholarship\n- **Status (2026-10-26):** Awarded at enrollment (pool and match)\n- **Scope:** rochester-msf\n- **Programs:** rochester-msf\n- **HK eligible:** yes · **TW eligible:** yes · **International:** yes · **PRC:** yes\n\n## Summary\nEstablished through support of Evans Lam ’84S (MBA). Awarded to five outstanding full-time MS students each year at the time of enrollment via a pool and match approach.\n\n## Eligibility\nOutstanding full-time Simon MS students (includes MS Finance). Citizenship limits not stated on page.\n\n## Amount\nNot published (five awards per year)\n\n## Deadline\nAt enrollment (no separate public application described)\n\n## Notes\nNamed award distinct from general auto merit (SCH-097).\n\n## Sources\n- [Simon Full-Time MS Tuition & Financial Aid — Evans Lam](https://simon.rochester.edu/programs/full-time-ms/tuition-financial-aid)\n\n_Do not treat amounts/deadlines as final; re-verify on the official page before applying._\n"
