    "body": "# Utah Eccles MSF Merit Scholarship (SCH-091)\n\n- **Category:** Merit-Based · **Type:** scholarship\n- **Status (2026-10-26):** Essay application after admission (new admits)\n- **Scope:** utah-msf\n- **Programs:** utah-msf\n- **HK eligible:** yes · **TW eligible:** yes · **International:** yes · **PRC:** yes\n\n## Summary\nAdmissions scholarship acknowledging academic, personal, and professional accomplishments. Potential award $0–$3,000. Separate 300–500 word essay to MSF@Utah.edu. Only one admissions scholarship per student. Funding limited; first-come first-serve. Requirements must be met before Nov 1 (spring) or June 1 (fall).\n\n## Eligibility\nNewly admitted MSF students who have not started the program. No citizenship restriction stated. UU employees on reduced tuition benefit ineligible. Program does not offer GA/fellowships.\n\n## Amount\n$0 – $3,000\n\n## Deadline\nBefore Nov 1 (spring start) or June 1 (fall start); first-come first-serve\n\n\n## Sources\n- [Utah Eccles MSF Tuition & Scholarships](https://eccles.utah.edu/programs/master-of-science-in-finance/tuition-scholarships-financial-aid/)\n\n_Do not treat amounts/deadlines as final; re-verify on the official page before applying._\n"
